WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.205 --> 00:00:03.442
The cookbook opens on its sections. Tap one to browse.

2
00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:07.753
Or search: suggestions appear as you type.

3
00:00:07.887 --> 00:00:11.100
Every recipe scales. Change the servings and every amount follows.

4
00:00:13.317 --> 00:00:16.532
Switch to US units, or tap a tinted amount to step through its units.

5
00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:19.219
Times in the method are timers. Tap one to start it.

6
00:00:19.382 --> 00:00:22.633
It keeps running at the top of the page while you move around.

7
00:00:23.469 --> 00:00:25.878
Keep a recipe in your favourites with one tap.

8
00:00:25.979 --> 00:00:28.585
Add its ingredients to the shopping list, at the servings you chose.

9
00:00:28.732 --> 00:00:31.940
The list is sorted by aisle. Tap an amount to change it, or tick it off.

10
00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:34.702
Ask the sous-chef about the recipe: swaps, timings, making it ahead.

11
00:00:34.835 --> 00:00:39.046
The answer appears as it is written.

12
00:00:39.263 --> 00:00:42.502
Add a recipe of your own. A title, the ingredients and the method are all it needs.

13
00:00:44.456 --> 00:00:46.862
Paste the whole ingredient list at once.

14
00:00:51.777 --> 00:00:54.982
Write the method as you would say it: times and temperatures become timers.

15
00:00:55.079 --> 00:00:58.297
It is saved in this browser, ready to cook from. Settings can share it with everyone.
